    <p class="page-kicker">
        <i class="bi bi-diagram-3" aria-hidden="true"></i> Connected applications
    </p>
    <h1>
        Systems and API Integration
    </h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
        Connecting applications, services, data, and identity to support reliable product delivery.
    </p>
</header>
<div class="reading-layout">
    <nav class="section-nav" aria-label="On this page">
